assets/library.json: unchanged tools/kagami_gui/fragments/library.json.
assets/elements.json: unchanged tools/kagami_gui/elements.json.
tests/fixtures/*.kgui.json: copies of examples/gui_builder projects.

src/model/document.cpp, src/model/geometry.cpp, src/editing/library.cpp,
src/editing/operations.cpp, src/editing/peptide.cpp and src/editing/coordination.cpp
adapt the KAGAMI GUI document schema and builder algorithms from Python/NumPy
to native Qt6/C++/Eigen. src/ui/template_delegate.cpp and the palette setup
in src/ui/main_window.cpp adapt the thumbnails, labels and layout in
tools/kagami_gui/builder.py. src/editing/coordinates.cpp and
src/ui/coordinates_panel.cpp adapt coordinate editing and the atom dialog
from builder_integration.py and coordinate_atom_dialog.py to C++/Qt6,
with new NWChem geometry export.
src/ui/calculation_panel.cpp adapts the settings/preset workflow of job_tab.py
to native Qt6 and NWChem. src/nwchem/nwchem.cpp is new NWChem input generation and
validation code; it does not translate KAGAMI-specific computational methods.
src/ui/advanced_panel.cpp adapts search, filtering and reset workflows from
tools/kagami_gui/advanced_tab.py to native Qt6. src/nwchem/nwchem_advanced.cpp defines
new NWChem-specific settings rather than reusing KAGAMI's advanced keywords.
src/ui/execution_panel.cpp adapts the path, resource and environment settings
workflow of tools/kagami_gui/app.py. src/nwchem/nwchem_execution.cpp implements new
native NWChem/MPI launch validation, job snapshots, logging and cancellation.
src/ui/input_preview_panel.cpp adapts the read-only input preview and validation
navigation workflow of tools/kagami_gui/app.py, inspected on 2026-10-23,
to native Qt6 with NWChem input and execution-path previews.
src/ui/results_panel.cpp adapts the independent result browsing workflow of
tools/kagami_gui/results_tab.py (inspected on 2026-10-23). src/results/results.cpp is
new native parsing of NWChem output, XYZ, CUBE and MOLDEN, with marching
tetrahedra for isosurfaces. It does not depend on KAGAMI's readers or Python.
src/ui/history_panel.cpp adapts the history filtering, log browsing, reuse and
job-management workflow of tools/kagami_gui/app.py (inspected on 2026-10-23).
src/nwchem/history.cpp implements new native scanning and validation of NWChem run
bundles, with no dependency on KAGAMI's job records or Python.
The remaining UI and process worker are new.
The original license and notice are assets/KAGAMI-LICENSE and KAGAMI-NOTICE.
The latter describes the full upstream repository; MolForma does not include
KAGAMI's quantum-chemistry engine or its PySCF-derived code.

Qt6, Eigen3, optional RDKit and Open Babel 3 are system dependencies, not vendored here;
their own license terms apply. Open Babel is GPL-licensed. The Apache notice
for imported KAGAMI files does not license all linked dependencies.
